","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2025-07-31T14:15:41Z","updated_at":"2025-07-31T15:04:53Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4, 4.5\n\n### System information\n\nLinux\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf sharing the same custom texture across multiple scenes and the script of it changes, reloading saved scene doesn't update the texture. However, if you only open one scene that contains the texture, reloading will update it as expected.\n\n(I just tested custom textures, haven't tested if this issue also applies to other custom resource types)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open MRP, open at least 2 scenes\n- Modify the script to change the texture, e.g. change `Color.GREEN` to `Color.RED`\n- Reload saved scene. But the texture in scenes doesn't update. \n- Close other scenes, only remain one. Then reloading will update it as expected.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[reload-not-update-resource.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21531783/reload-not-update-resource.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109163/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109163/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}